GET {{anythingUrl}}/vars

::: query
value = {{nested}}
greeting = {{encodedGreeting}}

::: post
test("an environment value expands the variables it uses", () => {
  expect(res.json().args.value).toBe("Ada Lovelace");
  expect(res.json().args.greeting).toBe("aGVsbG8gd29ybGQ=");
  expect(res.json().path).toBe("/anything/vars");
});

::: docs
`nested` is `{{userName}}`, `anythingUrl` is `{{baseUrl}}/anything` and `shout` calls a template
function on another variable (#301).
